{"video":"2Se_tTKCC-4","lines":[{"t":[0,4.6],"en":"I sincerely hope the rest of your party is returning."},{"t":[4.6,7.2],"en":"Nah, just me, all alone."},{"t":[11.9,13.5],"en":"Dinner for six for one."},{"t":[15.5,18.5],"en":"Well, you boys are about to see something really special."},{"t":[30,33.6],"en":"- How was everything, sir? - Excellent."},{"t":[33.6,36.3],"en":"The shrew in particular was exquisite."},{"t":[38.1,39.8],"en":"Well, I hope you've got some room left."},{"t":[39.8,43.1],"en":"Happy birthday to you."},{"t":[43.1,46.1],"en":"Happy birthday to you."},{"t":[46.1,48.4],"en":"Happy birthday, dear."},{"t":[48.4,51.4],"en":"- Joey, Joey. - Joey."},{"t":[51.4,54.6],"en":"Happy birthday to you."},{"t":[54.6,56.4],"en":"It's the best birthday ever."},{"t":[60,65],"en":"Happy birthday to you."}]}
